# Keep LF line endings on every platform. Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true would
# otherwise turn files into CRLF, which breaks the POSIX shell hook (pre-task.sh) and any
# byte-for-byte comparison of managed text (AGENTS.md contract, CLAUDE.md, .gitignore blocks).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
